# Lizard Skins (sandoria 15): Hanaa Punaa in Southern San d'Oria. The guard (fame level 2 and The Seamstress completed):
# a trade while available (nothing), the guard false on The Seamstress's side (its 528) and on the fame side (The
# Seamstress's 590), the offer 559 declined (Prog 1), 562 declined and taken, the accepted 560, the wrong trades, 561 for
# exactly three Lizard Skins (Lizard Gloves, the skins taken, Lizard Skinner, completed: fame +10), the completed 591
# below fame level 3, the repeat 561, and at fame level 3 Black Tiger Skins' offer instead of 591.
# Hanaa Punaa has no script and no default event; The Seamstress and Black Tiger Skins also name her.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Hanaa_Punaa/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Hanaa_Punaa/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/559 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/562 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/561
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-178.2,-8.8,27.6
fame Sandoria 50
item LizardSkin x6
item BoneChip
login
trade Hanaa_Punaa LizardSkin x3           # available (and The Seamstress available): no trade handler, nothing
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # fame level 2, The Seamstress not completed: The Seamstress's 528
finish option=1                           # The Seamstress: its Prog 1
quest Sandoria.TheSeamstress completed
fame Sandoria 49
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # The Seamstress completed, fame level 1: The Seamstress's 590
finish
fame Sandoria 50
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # fame level 2: 559
finish option=1                           # not option 0: Prog 1
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # Prog 1: 562
finish option=1                           # not option 0: nothing
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # 562
finish                                    # option 0: begun
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # accepted: 560
finish
trade Hanaa_Punaa BoneChip x1             # nil (The Seamstress's completed trade: nil too)
trade Hanaa_Punaa LizardSkin x2           # two: nil
trade Hanaa_Punaa LizardSkin x3 BoneChip x1  # not exactly three: nil
trade Hanaa_Punaa LizardSkin x3           # exactly three: 561
finish                                    # Lizard Gloves, the skins taken, Lizard Skinner, completed (fame 60)
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # completed, fame level 2: 591
finish
trade Hanaa_Punaa LizardSkin x3           # completed: 561 again
finish                                    # Lizard Gloves, the skins taken, the title, fame +10 (70); no completion
fame Sandoria 125
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # completed, fame level 3: no 591; Black Tiger Skins' offer 576
finish option=1                           # Black Tiger Skins declined: its Prog 1
